course: dictionary
lesson: 11652
title: Words about art and creativity
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words tell you about making art, and artistic is one of them. It can describe a person who is good at creative things like drawing, painting, music or design. «Maya is very artistic. She painted stars all over her bedroom wall.» The sentence tells you Maya is good at making pictures.
explain: Artistic can also mean to do with art or artists. «The art club is visiting a gallery on Friday to look at artistic work.» Here artistic is about art itself, not about a person. Check by swapping in a simple word like art-related: if the sentence still makes sense, you have the right meaning.
explain: Artistic can describe something that is attractive and made with skill and imagination. «The cake had an artistic design of swirls and flowers.» The cake looks lovely because someone worked on it with care and imagination.
fact: Artistic means good at art or creative things like drawing, painting, music or design.
fact: Artistic also means to do with art or artists.
fact: Artistic can describe something attractive that was made with skill and imagination.
fact: Artistic talent, artistic skills and artistic flair all mean a special ability for creative work.
fact: Artistic is an adjective, so it describes a noun: an artistic pupil, an artistic design. It changes to more artistic and most artistic when you compare.
exercise: «Maya is very artistic. She painted stars on her bedroom wall.» What does artistic mean here? | Tired after a long day | Always late for school | *Good at creative things like painting | Afraid of the dark
exercise: Ella's mum says the poster is artistic. What does artistic describe? | *Something attractive and made with skill and imagination | A kind of cold weather | A person who runs very fast | A loud noise from the street
exercise: Which word means good at drawing, painting or music? | *Artistic | Quick | Happy | Noisy
test: «The school show needed artistic skills, so Sam painted the scenery.» What does artistic mean? | *Good at creative work | Cold and wet | Quiet and calm | Very fast
test: «The artistic design on the vase was lovely.» What does artistic describe here? | A sport played in teams | A loud sound | *Attractive and made with skill and imagination | A type of food
exam: «The class studied artistic subjects like drawing and music.» What does artistic mean here? | Fast | Very large | Sleepy | *To do with art
